"Notice how the <strong>service</strong> we are offering has been configured:"
msgstr ""
"Remarquez la configuration du <strong>service</strong> que nous proposons :"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that the certification is complete and sent to the customer, we can "
"<strong>mark the task as done</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Maintenant que la certification est terminée et envoyée au client, nous "
"pouvons <strong>marquer la tâche comme étant terminée</strong>."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now, <strong>register their payment</strong>. (Note: your customer can also "
"directly pay from their portal 💡)"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Enregistrez maintenant le paiement</strong>. (Remarque : votre "
"client peut également payer directement depuis son portail 💡)."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once you're done filling in the worksheet, simply click on 'Send Report' to "
"<strong>send your customer the certification</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Une fois que vous avez rempli la feuille de travail, il vous suffit de "
"cliquer sur 'Envoyer le rapport' pour <strong>envoyer la certification à "
"votre client</strong>."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.view_page_contactus
msgid "One of our experts will get back to you within 24 business hours."
msgstr ""

#. module: certification_organism
#: model:project.task.type,name:certification_organism.planning_project_stage_1
msgid "Planned"
msgstr "Planifié"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model:crm.tag,name:certification_organism.crm_tag_10
msgid "Pressure Equipment"
msgstr ""

