msgid "Pressure Equipment &amp;amp; Gas"
msgstr ""

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.view_page_contactus
msgid "Scaffolding &amp;amp; Work at Height"
msgstr ""

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Send your customer the <strong>invoice</strong>. Note that it will also be "
"available in their <strong>portal</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Envoyez la <strong>facture</strong> à votre client. Notez qu'elle sera "
"également disponible sur son <strong>portail</strong>."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:certification_organism.soft_dependency_server_action
msgid "Soft dependency"
msgstr "Dépendance souple"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.contactus
msgid "Submit"
msgstr "Soumettre"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.view_page_contactus
msgid "Thank you for your request"
msgstr ""

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Thanks to Studio, you can entirely <strong>customize the report</strong> to "
"fit your needs. Add as many fields of any type as you'd like."
msgstr ""
"Grâce à Studio, vous pouvez entièrement <strong>personnaliser le rapport</"
"strong> en fonction de vos besoins. Ajoutez autant de champs que vous le "
"souhaitez, quel que soit leur type."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Thanks to the '<strong>Worksheet Template</strong>' we selected for the "
"product and on the task, our form has all of the necessary fields for this "
"kind of certification."
msgstr ""
"Grâce au '<strong>Modèle de feuille de travail</strong>' que nous avons "
"sélectionné pour le produit et la tâche, notre formulaire contient tous les "
"champs nécessaires pour ce type de certification."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The certification will remain available to your customer at any time in "
"their <strong>portal</strong>, where they will be able to download and print "
"the report if needed. Click on the 'C<strong>ustomer Preview</strong>' "
"button to\n"
"                    get a sneak peek of what it'll look like for your "
"customer."
msgstr ""
"La certification sera disponible pour votre client à tout moment dans son  "
"<strong>portail</strong>, où il pourra télécharger et imprimer le rapport si "
"nécessaire. Cliquez sur le bouton '<strong>Aperçu client</strong>' pour\n"
"                    avoir un aperçu de ce à quoi ressemblera la "
"certification pour votre client."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model:project.task.type,name:certification_organism.project_task_type_17
msgid "This Month"
msgstr "Ce mois"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model:project.task.type,name:certification_organism.project_task_type_16
msgid "This Week"
msgstr "Cette semaine"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:certification_organism.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This task will directly get the right certification form for this type of "
"intervention thanks to the '<strong>Worksheet Template</strong>' selected on "
"the product."
msgstr ""
"Cette tâche permet d'obtenir directement le formulaire de certification "
"approprié pour ce type d'intervention grâce au '<strong>Modèle de feuille de "
"travail</strong>' sélectionné sur le produit."

#. module: certification_organism
#: model:project.task.type,name:certification_organism.project_task_type_15
msgid "Today"
msgstr "Aujourd'hui"

#. module: certification_organism
#: model:website.menu,name:certification_organism.website_menu_4
